      "content": "i dont know. i feel like im just drifting. sometimes i look at the pills on the counter or the edge of the balcony and it doesnt even feel scary. it just feels like... an exit. like he's waiting for me on the other side and it would be so much easier to just go be with him than to keep fighting this emptiness. wouldn't it be more peaceful to just go?",
